-- WHY THIS FILE HAS TO EXIST, AND WHY IT COULD NOT BE GENERATED BEFORE.
-- Release seed coverage flagged 15 metadata primaryKeys in no migration: the `Accounting` action
-- category, 2 Actions with their 11 Action Params, and the ERP daily-sync Scheduled Job.
