-- They were unshippable for a reason worth recording: `metadata/action-categories/` and
-- `metadata/actions/` had NO `.mj-sync.json`. MetadataSync only walks directories that declare
-- their entity, so it skipped both **silently** -- the push reported success over 8 of 10
-- directories and nobody saw the other two. bizapps-orders and bizapps-common have one in every
-- directory; this app was missing exactly the two that hold its Actions. Both configs are added in
-- the same change, and `directoryOrder` now names all ten directories with the categories ahead of
-- what references them.
